The '''Sanguinesti staff''' is a one-handed [[powered staff]] requiring 82 [[Magic]] to wield, available as a rare drop from the [[Theatre of Blood]]. Like most powered staves, it is only tradeable when it is fully uncharged. Named after the [[Sanguinesti region]], the staff was crafted by Lord [[Lowerniel Drakan]] himself, and was given to Lady [[Verzik Vitur]] as a gift for her assistance in the [[Misthalin–Morytania War]].{{CiteNews|url=http://services.runescape.com/m=news/the-theatre-of-blood?oldschool=1|title=The Theatre of Blood|newsdate=7 June 2018|quote=One of the more recent additions to Lady Verzik's collection, the Sanguinesti staff is a powerful weapon that was crafted by Lord Lowerniel Drakan himself. The staff was given to Lady Verzik by Lord Lowerniel Drakan as a reward for assisting him in their fights against the Seven Priestly Warriors.}}

The Sanguinesti staff can be combined with a [[holy ornament kit]] to make a [[Saradomin]]-themed [[holy Sanguinesti staff]]. Though its stats do not change, it makes it usable as a [[Saradomin]] item in the [[God Wars Dungeon]].

The staff's charge cannot be used against another player in dangerous PvP, only safe minigames.

