Players can uncharge the staff whenever and wherever they choose, getting all of the blood runes back.

==Maximum hit==
<math>\begin{align}
\text{Max Hit} &= \lfloor \frac{\text{MagicLevel}}{3} \rfloor\\
\end{align}</math>

The base [[Maximum Magic hit|maximum hit]] dealt by the staff is dependent on the player's current [[Magic]] level, starting at 27 with level 82 Magic and increasing by one every three Magic levels, up to a maximum of 41 at level 123 (obtainable only through [[smelling salts]] in [[Tombs of Amascut]]). Both magic damage bonuses and visible stat boosts will modify the max hit of the spell; likewise, stat-reductions will lower the damage. Invisible boosts, such as from the staff's attack styles, do not affect the max hit. The staff always has a maximum hit of at least 6, even when reduced to 0 magic. Compared to the other three powered staves, the [[trident of the seas]] has a lower base maximum hit by 5 (max of 20 at level 75), the [[trident of the swamp]] has a lower base maximum hit by 2 (max of 24 at level 78), and [[Tumeken's shadow]] has a higher base maximum hit by 2 (max of 29 at level 85).

